          "value": "Flower, Sun, and Rain",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Flower, Sun, and Rain is set on the Micronesian island resort of Lospass, and is loosely connected to the events of The Silver Case. The story follows Sumio Mondo, a \"searcher\" who makes a living looking for things people have lost. Mondo is initially contracted to defuse a bomb planted on a plane, but is so distracted with helping the islanders that the bomb goes off. He ends up caught in a timeloop, where he relives the same day running up to the explosion. Gameplay focuses on Mondo exploring the island, solving numerical puzzles with the help of his computer \"Catherine\" to solve people's problems on Lospass.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Flower, Sun, and Rain transcurre en el complejo turístico de la isla micronesia de Lospass y está vagamente relacionado con los acontecimientos de The Silver Case. La historia sigue a Sumio Mondo, un «buscador» que se gana la vida encontrando objetos que la gente ha perdido. Mondo es contratado inicialmente para desactivar una bomba colocada en un avión, pero se distrae tanto ayudando a los isleños que la bomba estalla. Termina atrapado en un bucle temporal, donde revive el mismo día que conduce a la explosión. La jugabilidad se centra en que Mondo explore la isla y resuelva puzles numéricos con la ayuda de su computadora «Catherine» para solucionar los problemas de la gente de Lospass.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2001",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
      ],
